      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْبَرُ</span></b>  <i>Wider in span;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْسَعُ شِبْرًا</span>. (A, TA.)
